          {
            "title": "Question #1",
            "id": 120354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando una richiesta HTTP non riesce, qual è una cosa che vogliamo sempre fare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Invia un messaggio di errore all'utente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Imposta il codice di stato su <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invia la richiesta a un altro server</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Invia un messaggio di errore all'utente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando una richiesta HTTP non riesce, qual è una cosa che vogliamo sempre fare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Invia un messaggio di errore all'utente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Imposta il codice di stato su <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invia la richiesta a un altro server</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ritentare la richiesta senza rispondere all'utente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Invia un messaggio di errore all'utente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #2",
            "id": 120359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la richiesta <code>GET</code> per salvare le informazioni inviate dal client.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>req.params</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #4",
            "id": 120357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale codice utilizziamo in questa richiesta <code>GET</code> per impostare il codice di stato HTTP?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.status</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.json</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res.status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il ramo per il membro mancante concatena <code>res.status(...).json(...)</code>. Cosa realizza questa concatenazione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Imposta lo stato di errore, poi invia il corpo JSON dell'errore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Invia prima il JSON, poi modifica lo stato dopo la conclusione della risposta</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Modifica il parametro della route prima di riprovare la query</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Trasforma la riga mancante in una risposta riuscita</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Imposta lo stato di errore, poi invia il corpo JSON dell'errore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #4",
            "id": 120361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per impostare un codice di errore <code>404</code> nell'oggetto response.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"222\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>.status(404)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL Database Connection",
            "id": 120848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come prepariamo un'istruzione SQL salvata nella variabile <code>sql</code>, dato che la connessione al database è memorizzata nella variabile <code>db</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.execute(sql)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.query(sql)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>db.prepare(sql)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposti <code>sql = \"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code>, poi scrivi <code>db.prepare(\"sql\")</code>.</p><p>Quale sostituzione prepara la query memorizzata?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM sql\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sql.prepare(db)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(db)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>db.prepare(sql)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Response",
            "id": 120935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali informazioni dovrebbe includere nella risposta un endpoint <code>POST</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un codice di stato e una conferma dell'aggiunta dei dati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un codice di stato e solo la nuova voce di dati</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo un codice di stato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un codice di stato e una conferma dell'aggiunta dei dati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hai aggiunto un volo. Quale risposta imposta uno stato adatto e conferma esplicitamente l'aggiunta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Stato <code>201</code> e <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Stato <code>404</code> e <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Stato <code>201</code> e solo i dati del nuovo volo</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Stato <code>201</code> e <code>\"Flight deleted successfully\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Stato <code>201</code> e <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Endpoint Path",
            "id": 120849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli l'endpoint corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:number&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"/flights\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'endpoint della raccolta che restituisce tutti i voli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get</code>, seguito da <code>\"/flights\"</code>, <code>\"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code> e infine <code>.all()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #2",
            "id": 120355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa fa il codice Express quando un utente richiede un membro che non esiste?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Invia al client un messaggio di errore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Si verifica un errore e il client non riceve alcuna informazione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il server richiede informazioni aggiuntive</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Invia al client un messaggio di errore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La ricerca nel database può non restituire alcun membro. Perché il gestore controlla il risultato prima di inviare il JSON di successo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per restituire l'errore relativo al membro mancante invece di una falsa risposta di successo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per ripetere la stessa ricerca finché non appare un membro</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per sostituire l'id richiesto con l'id del primo membro</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Per inserire automaticamente un nuovo membro quando non ne esiste alcuno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per restituire l'errore relativo al membro mancante invece di una falsa risposta di successo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL & PUT & DELETE",
            "id": 120994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tipo di istruzione SQL è associato a un endpoint PUT?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">AGGIORNA</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">ELIMINA</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">TRASCINA</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere AGGIORNA.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un gestore <code>PUT /flights/:id</code> sostituisce i campi memorizzati del volo identificato. Quale forma SQL corrisponde a questa operazione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP TABLE flights</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO flights ...</code> senza una condizione sull'id</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: DELETE II",
            "id": 120998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintassi di <code>response</code> per l'endpoint <code>DELETE</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { id } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = db.prepare(sql).run(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (result.changes &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight deleted successfully&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"197\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"201\" /><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"207\" /><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option startIndex=\"208\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>200</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
